  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_2049.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">A mediod&iacute;a de este domingo, 20 de julio, ha salido una expedici&oacute;n de unas 80 personas del Grupo Scout de Onda para pasar una semana de campamento en Ca&ntilde;izar del Olivar, en las cuencas mineras de Teruel. Regresan el domingo 27.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidascoutcampamentteruel/img_2034.jpg\" alt=\"img_2034\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidascoutcampamentteruel/img_2035.jpg\" alt=\"img_2035\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidascoutcampamentteruel/img_2036.jpg\" alt=\"img_2036\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidascoutcampamentteruel/img_2037.jpg\" alt=\"img_2037\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidascoutcampamentteruel/img_2038.jpg\" alt=\"img_2038\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidascoutcampamentteruel/img_2039.jpg\" alt=\"img_2039\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidascoutcampamentteruel/img_2040.jpg\" alt=\"img_2040\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidascoutcampamentteruel/img_2041.jpg\" alt=\"img_2041\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidascoutcampamentteruel/img_2042.